<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Find Path</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 18), Druid (guild level 34)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast find path &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Tells you which way to go to reach someone, anywhere in the world: "You 
should leave north." It works on people and creatures, not on places or 
things. To find your way home, name someone who lives there: for example, 
'cast find path mayor'.
</p><p>Each cast gives you the first step only: walk it, and cast again. The answer 
may also be "This is the place", that you should enter or leave something 
first, or that it's impossible from here.
</p><p>If the spell fails, you feel confused, and the one you look for feels that 
someone is trying to find them. You can cast it even while resting. It is 
also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
